{
  "name": "Cryogenics",
  "entries": [
    {
      "name": "Cryo Chamber",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "icon": "industrial_core:cryo_core",
          "title": "Cryo Chamber"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cold is made with heat here, like in a gas fridge. The chamber does not throw heat away, it burns it: heat is its fuel."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It is a 5×5×5 multiblock. The floor and ceiling are casing, the walls are cryo panels, there is a column of refrigeration chambers inside, and the core sits in the front row of the floor."
        },
        {
          "type": "multiblock",
          "pattern": {
            "key": {
              "K": "industrial_core:cryo_casing",
              "G": "industrial_core:cryo_glass",
              "F": "industrial_core:refrigeration_chamber",
              "R": "industrial_core:cryo_core"
            },
            "layers": [
              [
                "KKRKK",
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK"
              ],
              [
                "GGGGG",
                "G...G",
                "G.F.G",
                "G...G",
                "GGGGG"
              ],
              [
                "GGGGG",
                "G...G",
                "G.F.G",
                "G...G",
                "GGGGG"
              ],
              [
                "GGGGG",
                "G...G",
                "G.F.G",
                "G...G",
                "GGGGG"
              ],
              [
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK",
                "KKKKK"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "text": "**Any** casing block takes heat, so you can run pipes into the floor and ceiling at several spots at once."
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "industrial_core:cryo_core",
            "industrial_core:cryo_casing",
            "industrial_core:cryo_glass",
            "industrial_core:refrigeration_chamber"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Depth",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "icon": "industrial_core:cryo_core",
          "title": "Depth"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The chamber gradually sinks into the cold, and that is called **depth**. Depth depends on how much heat arrives per tick and settles right at it."
        },
        {
          "type": "stats",
          "rows": [
            {
              "key": "Stage one",
              "value": "200 heat per tick"
            },
            {
              "key": "Stage two",
              "value": "800"
            },
            {
              "key": "Stage three",
              "value": "1800"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "text": "Depth takes minutes to build and drops three times faster, so it is best never to switch the chamber off."
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "industrial_core:cryo_core",
            "industrial_core:heat_pipe_t2",
            "industrial_core:thermostation_core"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Depth Modules",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "icon": "industrial_core:depth_module_2",
          "title": "Depth Modules"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Without a module in the core the chamber will not go past stage one, no matter how much heat you feed it. **Module II** lets it reach stage two, **Module III** stage three."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Module III is made from Module II and a cryo crystal, and cryo crystals only come from stage two. So you only reach stage three after working at stage two."
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "industrial_core:depth_module_2",
            "industrial_core:depth_module_3",
            "industrial_core:cryo_crystal"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cryo Rods",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "icon": "industrial_core:cryo_rod",
          "title": "Cryo Rods"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Up to three rods go into the core. Each one speeds the chamber up: rod I by a quarter, II by half, III doubles it. The bonuses add up, so three rod III make it four times as fast."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rods wear out, and the deeper the chamber, the faster: nine times faster at stage three than at stage one."
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "industrial_core:cryo_rod",
            "industrial_core:cryo_rod_t2",
            "industrial_core:cryo_rod_t3"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Crystallizer",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "icon": "industrial_core:crystallizer",
          "title": "Crystallizer"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The only machine that turns a fluid into an item. Coolant with aluminum dust gives **cryolite**, and the whole cold branch is made from it: panels, casing, rods and modules."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It also freezes ice from a snow block and water, and casts solder from tin and molten lead, twice as much as the cutters give."
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "industrial_core:crystallizer",
            "industrial_core:cryolite",
            "industrial_core:aluminum_dust"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coolant",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "icon": "industrial_core:capsule",
          "title": "Coolant"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The chamber needs coolant: it flows through and comes out hot. Pump the hot coolant out, or the tank fills up and the chamber stops. Take it to the fluid enricher: with a pinch of lapis dust it turns back into coolant."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Do not pour it away: a capsule of hot coolant goes into the **cryogenic heat exchanger** recipe."
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "industrial_core:capsule",
            "industrial_core:capsule_filler",
            "industrial_core:cryogenic_heat_exchanger"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}